cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RESIST, please cite the following."
title: "RESIST: a single-cell and spatial omics resource of regulatory mechanisms underlying cancer drug resistance"
abstract: >-
  RESIST is a large-scale single-cell and spatial omics resource that
  systematically characterizes the regulatory mechanisms underlying cancer
  drug resistance across 81 scRNA-seq and 7 spatial transcriptome datasets,
  522 single-cell and 96 spatial samples, 13 cancer types and 59 drug
  regimens.
url: "https://resist.website/"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The RESIST authors"
keywords:
  - drug resistance
  - single-cell transcriptomics
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - neoantigen
  - alternative polyadenylation
version: "v6"
